</div>



<div class="tuts"><a name="tutorials"></a>
	<h2>How-To Articles</h2>
	<div class="-iscroll-horizontal"><div class="iScrollWrapper">
	<div class="card">
		<div class="video-decor">video</div>		<a href="/tutorials/cosplay-tutorial-iron-man-helmet-1-silicone-glove-mold/">
			<p class="thumb"><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/pw/site/assets/files/36125/ironmanhelmet-mold.gif" alt="Cosplay Tutorial: Iron Man Helmet - Part 1: How To Make a Silicone Glove Mold" width="480" height="270"></p>
			<h3>Cosplay Tutorial: Iron Man Helmet - Part 1: How To Make a Silicone Glove Mold</h3>
		</a>
		<p class="blurb">How you can use Rebound 25 silicone rubber to make a mold of an Iron Man helmet.</p>
		<p class="more"><a href="/tutorials/cosplay-tutorial-iron-man-helmet-1-silicone-glove-mold/"><span class="ctaRedChevron">&rsaquo;</span>&nbsp;View How-To Article</a></p>
	</div>
	<div class="card">
		<div class="video-decor">video</div>		<a href="/tutorials/aquarium-decoration-tutorial-silicone-coral-stamp/">
			<p class="thumb"><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/pw/site/assets/files/24739/card-rebound-coral-stamp.jpg" alt="Aquarium Decoration Tutorial - How To Make a Silicone Coral Stamp" width="480" height="270"></p>
			<h3>Aquarium Decoration Tutorial - How To Make a Silicone Coral Stamp</h3>
